meta {
  name: diff two captured LLM agent runs
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/mockserver/llm/diffRuns
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "before": {
      "session": "run-1"
    },
    "after": {
      "session": "run-2"
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Compares two captured agent runs, each selected by session, host and/or provider, and reports where they diverge. Normalization options control which incidental differences are ignored before comparing. The request body is optional — an empty body is treated as an empty filter on both sides.
  
  optional selectors for the two runs to compare
  
  Full API reference: https://www.mock-server.com/mock_server/mockserver_clients.html
}
